# 27. ADMIN REMOTE ACTIONS

Admin must be able to:

## Disconnect

Immediately terminate active session.

## Disable user

User cannot start a new session.

Existing session should be revoked.

## Enable user

User can authenticate again.

## Increase quota

Example:

5 GB -> 10 GB.

Device should receive update.

## Reset quota

Set current usage allowance back to configured amount.

Define clearly whether reset starts a new billing/quota period or modifies the current session.

## Change time allowance

Example:

1 hour -> 3 hours.

## Revoke device

The device can no longer access the service.

